<title>CANADA: MOTOR RACING-LEADING PRACTICE TIMES FOR CANADIAN GRAND PRIX.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-LEADING PRACTICE TIMES FOR CANADIAN GRAND PRIX.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading times after Friday's</p>
<p>practice session for Sunday's Canadian Grand Prix motor race:</p>
<p>1. Heinz-Harald Frentzen (Germany) Williams one minute and</p>
<p>20.289 seconds (average speed 198.228 kph)</p>
<p>2. Giancarlo Fisichella (Italy) Jordan 1:20.416</p>
<p>3. Jacques Villeneuve (Canada) Williams 1:20.552</p>
<p>4. Jean Alesi (France) Benetton 1:20.624</p>
<p>5. Olivier Panis (France) Prost 1:20.727</p>
<p>6. Johnny Herbert (Britain) Sauber 1;20.876</p>
<p>7. Ralf Schumacher (Germany) Jordan 1;20.930</p>
<p>8. Eddie Irvine (Britain) Ferrari 1:20.987</p>
<p>9. Michael Schumacher (Germany) Ferrari 1:21.201</p>
<p>10. Rubens Barrichello (Brazil) Stewart 1:21.269</p>
<p>11. Alex Wurz (Austria) Benetton 1:21.315</p>
<p>12. Mika Hakkinen (Finland) McLaren 1:21.372</p>
